.TH DANBY-TABLETENNIS 1
.SH NAME
danby-tabletennis \- drag and topspin in table tennis
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/tabletennis
.SH MODEL
Quadratic drag slows the light ball while topspin supplies a downward Magnus
force, making the shot dip sooner than gravity alone.  Setting lift or topspin
to zero isolates the two effects.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/tabletennis.b
.SH SEE ALSO
